    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.doc\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.10.x\n\n### Description\n\nmini.doc has a chance of replacing a variable or identifier of `@param` or `@field` with a defined `@alias`.\n\n### Reproduction\n\n`minimal_init.lua`\n```lua\n-- DO NOT change the paths and don't remove the colorscheme\nlocal root = vim.fn.fnamemodify(\"./.repro\", \":p\")\n\n-- set stdpaths to use .repro\nfor _, name in ipairs({ \"config\", \"data\", \"state\", \"cache\" }) do\n  vim.env[(\"XDG_%s_HOME\"):format(name:upper())] = root .. \"/\" .. name\nend\n\n-- bootstrap lazy\nlocal lazypath = root .. \"/plugins/lazy.nvim\"\nif not vim.loop.fs_stat(lazypath) then\n  vim.fn.system({ \"git\", \"clone\", \"--filter=blob:none\", \"https://github.com/folke/lazy.nvim.git\", lazypath, })\nend\nvim.opt.runtimepath:prepend(lazypath)\n\n-- install plugins\nlocal plugins = {\n  { 'echasnovski/mini.doc' },\n}\nrequire(\"lazy\").setup(plugins, {\n  root = root .. \"/plugins\",\n})\n```\n\n\n`repro.lua`\n```lua\n-- :lua require(\"mini.doc\").generate({vim.fn.expand(\"%:p\")}, vim.fn.expand(\"%:p\") .. \".txt\")\n\n---@alias something Else\n\n---@class foo.something.Bar\n---@field something foo.something.Item\n---@field other fun(value: foo.something.Bar): nil\n\n---@param something foo.something.Item\n---@return something | foo.something.Item | foo.something.New\nfunction something(something) return something end\n```\n\nIt will output\n\n```\n==============================================================================\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nClass ~\n{foo.something.Bar}\nFields ~\n{Else} `(foo.something.Item)`\n{other} `(fun(value: foo.something.Bar): nil)`\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n                                                                   *something()*\n                              `something`({Else})\nParameters ~\n{Else} `(foo.something.Item)`\nReturn ~\n`(Else | foo.something.Item | foo.something.New)`\n\n\n vim:tw=78:ts=8:noet:ft=help:norl:\n```\n\nNote that \n\n```\nFields ~\n{Else} `(foo.something.Item)`\n```\n\nShould be\n```\nFields ~\n{something} `(foo.something.Item)`\n```\n\nand\n\n```\nParameters ~\n{Else} `(foo.something.Item)`\n```\n\nshould be\n\n```\nParameters ~\n{something} `(foo.something.Item)`\n```",
